# DayKare environment variables — copy to .env.local and fill in.
# NEVER commit real values. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Both Supabase variables are optional AND must be set together. With neither
# set, DayKare runs in local-only mode: fully playable, saves to this browser.
# With only one set, the game logs an error and falls back to local-only.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# These same public variables enable the authenticated 20-player Realtime room.
# Also enable Anonymous Sign-Ins and apply the latest Supabase migrations.

# The service-role key is a server-side secret. It must NEVER appear in a
# VITE_ variable, in the client bundle, or in this repository. It arrives in
# Phase 7 with the authoritative game server, held by that server only.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
